    "payload": {
      "from": "support@acme-corp.example",
      "to": [
        "customer@example.com"
      ],
      "cc": [],
      "subject": "Re: cannot export invoices for March",
      "body_text": "Hi,\n\nThanks for the report. The export endpoint was rate-limited above the documented threshold last week — we've raised it back to 50 req/min. Please retry the March export and let us know if it still fails.\n\nIf you need the data sooner, I can run the export on our side and email you the CSV directly.\n\nBest,\nSupport",
      "in_reply_to_message_id": "<CADx7HnZ@example.com>",
      "ticket_id": "ZD-48211"
    },
    "rationale": "The export issue maps to the documented rate-limit incident. Confirm the fix and offer a manual export as fallback.",
